  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UNDP Bosnia and Herzegovina SCORE</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Three decades after the Dayton Peace Agreement, BIH remains deeply divided. The overall objective of the project is to improve social cohesion in Bosnia and Herzegovina through an evidence-based understanding of divisive narratives and opportunities to build trust. This will lead to data-driven interventions aimed at shaping an enabling environment for the country&#x2019;s democratic development and European integration. 
Implementing partner is UNDP.</narrative>
  </description>
